  "material_learning": "High within-day movement-volume coupling is not an independent DRA entry-quality signal. The primary removed 34 of 79 Validation signals and modestly reduced drawdown, underwater duration and holding, but lost 14.13203543 USDT of total PnL and 13.73076248 USDT of realized PnL; every calendar year lost total PnL. Design also lost 91.48094814 USDT, worsened drawdown, added two terminal lots and extended underwater duration. The permissive 0.30 neighbor came closest but still lost total and realized PnL, worsened drawdown and won zero years, while the restrictive 0.70 neighbor deteriorated further. The evidence is consistent with contemporaneous reaction or liquidation volume rather than persistent participation alpha.",
  "reproducibility_note": "The first pre-economic execution attempt stopped with DATA_REJECT because the sealed corpus contains non-positive-volume hours. Before any economic result was emitted, the runner was corrected to apply the already frozen FEATURE_UNAVAILABLE_NO_INTERPOLATION rule at the complete-day level. Final run1 and run2 use the runner hash bound above and are byte-identical.",
  "prohibited_reopen": [
